window.products.push({"id":462081,"name":"Westbrooke Linen Queen Bed Sheets - 100% Pure Cotton 400 Thread Count, 4 Piece Sateen Weave Bedding Set, Soft & Comfy Nanosil Grey Silver Sheets, 16 I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eWf74jViL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOST COMFORTABLE 400 THREAD COUNT COTTON SHEETS YOU WILL SLEEP ON - Wrap yourself in the softness and comfort of these 400 thread count luxury sheets. Made from 100% long staple cotton, our high thread count collection is cooling, breathable, and cozy at the same time. The high quality sateen weave provides a premium lustrous finish and elegant look to the bedding ensemble. INDULGE IN LUXURY WITH THIS WONDERFUL 4-PIECE QUEEN SET - Bring home a touch of hotel luxury with bedding that is thicker than your average sheet. The 4 piece queen sheet set includes 1 flat sheet (90” W x 104” L), 1 fitted sheet (60” W x 80” L with 15.5 inch deep pocket), and 2 pillowcases (20” W x 32” L). The bottom sheet has a sizable deep pocket with an all-around elastic which makes tucking your sheets a delightful experience. FEEL THE SOFTNESS, WASH AFTER WASH - Each fabric is carefully assessed to ensure great quality is delivered with every durable and sturdy sheet. The sheets not only retain color over time but also get smoother after every wash. The sheets must be machine washed at room temperature, without any fabric softener, and tumble dried at low. To prevent wrinkles, the bed linens must be folded immediately after drying. EXPERTLY SEWN SPECIAL PLEATED HEM AND NON SLIP ELASTIC - The fitted sheet comes with a premium quality expandable elastic, allowing the bottom sheet to perfectly fit the mattress and stay intact. Each sheet and pillowcase comes with a special pleated hem that complements and enhances your home decor. The pillowcases also have a European flap enclosure to stop your pillow from peeking out of the covers. CERTIFIED AND SUSTAINABLE FOR TRUST - Manufactured using 100% Green energy generated from windmills, this bedding set is brought to you directly from Westbrooke Linens. The manufacturing processes are sustainable and vertically integrated, right from spinning the yarn to the finished product. Our products are made from OEKO-TEX 100 certified dyes, making them safe for adults and children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eWf74jViL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westbrooke","source_asin":"B0882V5BW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0882V5BW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0882V5BW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
