window.products.push({"id":462096,"name":"Prep Solutions by Progressive Big Green Recycling Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TEk3ksvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recycling just got an upgrade. You can easily crush 12 and 16 oz. cans and even 20 oz. plastic water bottles with this Prep Solutions by Progressive Big Green Recycling Machine. Easy slide action makes crushing aluminum soda and beer cans and plastic beverage bottles quick and simple. To compress plastic bottles, place neck side down into unique hole in base, crush down and replace bottle cap to keep crushed bottles from expanding. The soft-grip, long handle gives better leverage making the process smoother and more comfortable. For your convenience, the pre-drilled body makes for simple installation, mounting to any stud in the wall (Mounting Hardware NOT included)  For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today.  At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected.   Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing.  Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TEk3ksvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B0182IO9X0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0182IO9X0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0182IO9X0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462097,"name":"Vinotemp Vt-32 Beverage Cooler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BTNCN0+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description VT-32BCSB10 Features: -Beverage cooler. -Double paned glass door with stainless steel trim. -Front-vented unit for built-in or freestanding installation. -External digital control panel. Dimensions: Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -34.5 Inches. Overall Width - Side to Side: -15 Inches. Overall Depth - Front to Back: -21.75 Inches. Overall Product Weight: -74 Pounds. From the Manufacturer The Vinotemp VT-32 Beverage Cooler is a sleek and compact unit that features a double-paned glass door, black and stainless finish exterior, and a blue LED interior light. The external control panel includes a digital temperature display, which makes setting the desired storage temperature an easy task. The sturdy metal shelves of the VT-32BCSB will store approximately 56 8 ounce cans. A front exhaust system allows for built-in or freestanding installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BTNCN0+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vinotemp","source_asin":"B007124MVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007124MVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007124MVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462098,"name":"Emerilware by Wusthof 3-Piece Paring Knife Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TWNXFFT0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Razor-sharp Wusthof Gourmet paring knife set includes the blade styles every chef needs for efficient prep. Precision blades from the world's experts equip your kitchen with the cutlery preferred in international kitchens. Each blade is laser-cut from a single piece of German high-carbon, rust-free steel to exacting standards. Double-riveted for strength and longevity. Ergonomic handle provides a comfortable grip. Hand wash. Lifetime manufacturer warranty. The 3-inch clip point paring knife for expert peeling, dicing, mincing and slicing. Perfect to dice or slice green peppers, onions and red potatoes. Peel, pit and slice peaches for pies or preserves. Razor-sharp cutting edge with clipped tip to shape broccoli and cauliflower florets with minimal pressure and create gourmet appetizers. This knife cuts precise slits in pastry and bread dough. The 2.25-inch bird's beak paring knife performs the up-close work with smaller fruits and vegetables. Shaped like a bird's beak, the curved blade on this 2.25-inch peeler follows the contours of apples, pears, persimmons, potatoes, and other round produce typically peeled in a single continuous motion. Cores and slices. Cleanly removes eyes from potatoes, trims stems and deveins shrimp. Gourmet 3-inch serrated paring knife quickly pierces thick skin and tough rind. Slices tomatoes and zucchini and penetrates the rind on lemons and limes. With the serrated edge, this paring knife is the \"go to\" knife for slicing small fruits and vegetables. Wusthof knives are created with dedication to old world craftsmanship and the best cutting-edge technology. This traditional German craftsmanship sets the industry standard for design, quality, durability and manufacturing excellence. Ergonomic contoured handles provide a comfortable grip. Hand wash. Lifetime manufacturer warranty. Since 1814, knives bearing the Wusthof name and the Trident logo have been crafted in the world's \"Cutlery Capital,\" Solingen Germany. Amazon.com Signed by celebrity chef Emeril Lagasse (Bam!) and made by celebrated cutlery manufacturer Wüsthof, the three paring knives in this moderately priced set have the same three-rivet, virtually indestructible poly handles as Wüsthof's premium Classic knives. Instead of being forged, however, the blades and full tangs are cut from steel sheets by precision lasers. That means no bolsters, but it also means the knives are perfectly shaped and fit their handles seamlessly. Moreover, the blades' high-carbon stainless steel is identical to that of Wüsthof's premium knives, only thinner. The three knives equip a kitchen for all little tasks. One has a 3-inch blade with a straight, serrated edge and a drop point for slicing tomatoes and soft fruits. Another has a tapered, 3-inch blade with a sharp point for peeling fruits and vegetables. The third has a sharply curved blade, known as a bird's beak, for shaping vegetables. The knives are dishwasher-safe, but hand washing is recommended to protect their edges. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TWNXFFT0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00006C7HE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006C7HE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006C7HE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462099,"name":"Full / Double 3 Inch iSoCore 2.0 Memory Foam Mattress Topper American Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sjaNFLJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The iSoCore 2.0 next generation foam open cell topper is designed to offer the absolute ultimate in soft supple contouring comfort at an affordable price that will not keep you up all night. The iSoCore line is the answer that you have been waiting for to help you sleep better if you have any problems because your mattress is hard, lumpy, transfers motion, creates pressure points or is just too firm. You will experience incredibly soft shape conforming comfort that will allow you to sleep good throughout the night and awake feeling recharged and reenergized with the ability to make it throughout the day feeling reinvigorated and well rested. iSoCore Foam has been an integral part of the evolution of foam since its inception over 60 years ago, all the way through the years. The iSoCore family has led the way with innovation making the brand synonymousand competitive with the nationally advertised brands but with a slight difference. This company is run by a family owned business that still believes in quality, craftsmanship and taking pride in the foam they produce and great care in their customers overall satisfaction. The iSoCore open cell foam line unlike other competing products on the market is Manufactured and Made right here in the U.S.A. by an American Workforce and the money you spend stays here in the U.S. economy. There is also an additional advantage to our grass roots manufacturing efforts, you can safely say that your mattress topper will be made with care so that you can sleep soundly with peace of mind, an important part of feeling good about the products you purchase for yourself, for your family and for your friends. iSoCore has a commitment contract to always take care of its customers and stands behind every item they produce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sjaNFLJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iSoCore Foam","source_asin":"B00LDFJVG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LDFJVG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LDFJVG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
