window.products.push({"id":462122,"name":"Yaheetech Kitchen Island Cart on Wheels with 3 Drawers and 3 Open Shelves, Rolling Kitchen Island Coffee Bar Trolley with Bamboo Countertop, Removable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wG7hnfWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Practical storage compartments】Our utility kitchen organizer consists of a bamboo top, three utility drawers and three removable shelves. The tabletop will be a nice place to store a microwave or other small-sized appliances. The drawers with cut-out handles are smooth to slide in/out, and perfect for storing culinary tools and spice jars, while three shelves offer plenty of space for pantry items and help you sort them more properly. 【Removable shelves】The cart has three removable shelves to store any number of kitchen essentials such as egg-beater, small appliances or some fruits and snacks. Besides, the shelves can be removed and cleaned without difficulties if needed. If you want to put high wine bottles and goblets, you can remove the second shelf to free up more space. 【Must-have mobility】Stands on four universal wheels (2 with brakes), this rolling kitchen island boasts super convenience and effortless maneuverability and can lock into place if needed. 【Kitchen organizer】As a must-have item in a busy kitchen, our functional kitchen island trolley might be a good organizer in your kitchen. It provides ample room for storing a variety of everyday essentials, keeping vegetables, dishes, spices, cooking and eating utensils, plates, microwave and other kitchen accessories in plain sight and easy to access. 【Durable kitchen cart】This practical kitchen cart is mainly composed of CARB P2-compliant MDF cart, durable bamboo top and pinewood legs, it boasts durability and can totally hold up to 75kg/165lb. The powder-coated surface is smooth and easy to clean. The bamboo countertop with powder coating surface ensures its high strength and good maneuverability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wG7hnfWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B08KV8RB5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KV8RB5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KV8RB5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
