window.products.push({"id":462234,"name":"Flask Water Bottles: Sportneer 26oz Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle Reusable Double Walled Metal Bottle Cola Shape Thermos Leak-Proof 24 Hours ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wKllSj8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEAK-PROOF & SPILL-PROOF - The classic shape and premium, sturdy build aren’t the only functional aspects of this stainless steel water bottle. The flask water bottle is also leak-proof and can be held upside-down with zero leakage. No drink spill with the narrow mouth design, which is perfectly sized at 33mm to accommodate ice cubes. Now that’s refreshing! KEEPS COLD 24H, HOT 12H - Normal mugs don’t keep beverages at the right temperature for very long, but the Sportneer insulated metal thermoses water bottle can! Key to this refillable metal water bottle’s insulating success is the double-walled, vacuum-insulated construction. Keep hot beverages warm for up to 12 hours and cold liquids chilled for up to 24 hrs. It’s a thoughtful gift that family and friends can use every day! STAINLESS STEEL & SWEAT-FREE - Built to last, this simple modern cola shape insulated water bottle is constructed with food-grade 18/304 stainless steel. Finished with a scratch-resistant, anti-condensation exterior and a double-coating, rust-proof shatter-proof, you’re sure to find the refillable water bottle useful on all your adventures, big and small. Better yet, no moisture in your bag or rings on your desk. IDEAL SIZE & IDEAL CHOICE - So light you won’t even feel it, this small vacuum insulated water bottle weighs just over half a pound and fits in most standard-sized cup holders as well as side water bottle pockets on backpacks. An ideal companion to the gym, yoga class, school, sports, canteen or in the car or backpack, perfect for travel and on the go lifestyle. With BOTTLE BRUSH - Cleaning bottles can be tricky and the dishwasher can’t clean this bottle deeply enough. Thankfully, this travel water bottle comes with a bonus bottle brush which can be used to scrub deep into the bottle with ease. Lastly, it comes with a black bottle cover along with a carrying strap for ultimate portability. How’s that for a cup of coffee whenever you want one?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wKllSj8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sportneer","source_asin":"B08GRZQ7HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GRZQ7HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GRZQ7HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
