window.products.push({"id":462281,"name":"Bamber Wood Picture Frames 11x14 Picture Frame Set Rustic Picture Frames Black Picture Frames Vintage Wedding Family Wall Wooden Picture Frames, Pack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cU9WKilYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Permanently Protect Your Photos No plastic, no composite wood, made of 100% natural Eco solid wood, our picture frame sets provide a permanent protection for your cherish photos. The front glass is constructed by premium acrylic, whose transparency is on a par with real glass, but not easy to break. Both surfaces of acrylic glass are carefully protected by a piece of film and just remove them before you use it. A sturdy backboard securely keeps your photo stay in place. Exquisite Decoration for Your Rooms A rustic wood picture frame, sure to become a classic, is ideal for a wide range of decor styles from rustic to modern. The photo frame showcases uniquely worn surfaces, with vintage handcraftsmanship to display an old time feeling. The moulding is constructed of New Zealand pine with a painted finish. The picture frame matches any print and is a perfect fit for primitive decor. Two Ways of Display If you are looking for some photo frames to display your photos on desk or wall in a same style, this picture frame combination is an ideal option for you. Built with hanging hardware on two sides of back, the picture holders can be mounted on wall for vertical or horizontal display. Quick Assembly It is easy to be assembled by placing the glass, picture and the backboard one by one, then lock the backboard by tiny locks on the back. Specifications: Frame Material: Natural Solid Wood Image Size Held: 4 x 6 / 5 x 7/ 8 x 10 / 11 x 14 inches Outer Dimensions: 5.7L x 7.7W x 0.7H inches / 6.9L x 8.9W x 0.7H inches / 9.7L x 11.7W x 0.7H inches / 13L x 16W x 0.8H inches  Frame Display: Hanging Triangle, Easel Back Frame Orientation: Horizontal or Vertical Home Placement: tabletop or wall mount Color: Rustic Black / Light Green Care and Cleaning: Wipe Clean Surface Cover Material: Premium Acrylic Glass","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cU9WKilYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamber","source_asin":"B07ZFJKZ5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZFJKZ5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZFJKZ5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
