window.products.push({"id":462313,"name":"Department 56 Possible Dreams Bon Apetit Santa Candy Man Figurine, 10.5 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMVeE2B4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed in the US, every Possible Dreams Santa is hand-made by a team of skilled artisans. Individually sculpted with unique facial expressions and poses, personality and sometimes humor - no two Santa's are the same! Each piece is painted and assembled with intricate detail and artistic expertise. Our signature stiffened fabric, mixed media, bottom stamp and brass tag certifies an authentic Possible Dreams Santa. Possible Dreams' Bon Appetit Collection is filled with drinks and treats of the Christmas season. From hot cider to milk and cookies, the winter celebration starts with the taste buds. This Jolly Santa carries colorful sweets for everyone on his Good List. Dressed in Clothtique Fabrics, with fur trim and has the signature brass tag. About Department 56: For 40 years, Department 56 has been creating holiday traditions passed down from generation to generation. The excitement of the holiday season comes home with intricately detailed villages from settings that inspire the imagination. Stroll through a small American town, enjoy a walk with Charles Dickens, or visit Santa in the North Pole. Our ornaments and figurines create even more opportunities to spread good wishes during the happiest time of the year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMVeE2B4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B08THTD5VG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THTD5VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THTD5VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
