window.products.push({"id":462365,"name":"62in. Wheat Grass Artificial Plant in Ribbed Metal Planter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lfRHQnAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wheat all about it. Bring straight lines to your space with this Wheat Grass artificial plant. Vertical grass blades of mix-matched heights form green foliage that brings visual interest to any area. Some of the wheat spikes, top portion, have multihued tips, bringing a pop of color. Standing 62” from a ribbed metal planter (included in height), curate in spaces that need a focal point. Perfect for rooms that need a refresh. For an elevated look, curate with some artificial bush plants for contrasting textures.Silk plants are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item will need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your artificial plant will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed. About Nearly Natural Inc. - For over 75 years, Nearly Natural Inc. has been providing conscientious consumers with beautiful alternatives to natural decorations. Employing and advised by naturalists who understand the live plant world, Nearly Natural is able to recreate the most realistic-looking decorative items for homes, offices, and businesses. Driven by a true commitment to customer service, attention to detail, and natural philosophy, Nearly Natural strives to bring customers the most beautiful, unique, and striking faux plants and floral on the market. Construction materials: Styrofoam, Moss, Zinc, Iron Wire, Plastic, PVC","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lfRHQnAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B08TQCLS6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TQCLS6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TQCLS6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
