window.products.push({"id":462392,"name":"AAAAAcessories 4-Foot Bean Bag Chair - Foam Filled Furniture with Protective Liner Plus Ultra Soft and Machine Washable Cover - Large Bean Bag Chair w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BRiTMi9qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STANDARD SIZE SACKS: 48 x 48 x 30 inches - Our bean bag furniture for adults and kids is filled with 100% shredded polyurethane durable foam in polyester liner which wrapped in a soft velvet cover, That makes the product comfortable and soft to the touch. SUPER SOFT COVER: Premium Velvet fabric covered the surface and provides great touch feelings, prevents pilling, skin irritation, fur shedding and color fading. The Double Stitched Seams made the cover more durable. On the side, a 9cm wide handle is designed to facilitate moving your sofa. MACHINE WASHABLE: Our Comfy Outer Covers is machine washable. We use the extra long hidden zipper at the bottom of cover won't leave any scratches on the floor while moving and make the cover easy to remove and clean. HIGH QUALITY FOAM: AAAAAcessories Bean Bag Chairs are filled with adequate soft and resilient high-density shredded foam, that is extremely long-lasting yet supportive while increasing comfort levels you have never experienced. GREAT FOR ANY ROOM: This soft filled furniture is the perfect addition in bedrooms, college student dorm rooms and living rooms for family movie night, game night, play date, and reading, this sofa is a perfect compliment to any decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BRiTMi9qS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAAAAcessories","source_asin":"B08Q3ZBJDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q3ZBJDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q3ZBJDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462393,"name":"Panasonic NI-S650TR 1200-Watt Steam Iron with Curved Titanium-Coated Soleplate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-DtRmcxTL._AC_SL1441_.jpg","description":"Steam out wrinkles quickly and easily with this 1200-watt iron. The unit's titanium-coated curved soleplate provides smooth, gentle gliding, while its temperature ranges from 176 to 392 degrees F to accommodate a variety of different fabrics. The iron's jet-of-steam function delivers a powerful burst of steam to help remove stubborn wrinkles (or to help clean the steam vents), and its push-button micro spray mist makes smaller particles and spreads it evenly over a wider area for faster results. The iron also offers adjustable steam settings for heavier fabrics or simple touch-ups, as well as a \"dry\" setting for no steam output. To ensure safety, its mercury-free electronic sensor automatically shuts off the iron after 10 minutes if left in the upright position and after 60 seconds if left unmoved on its soleplate or if tipped over on its side. Other highlights include a 6-ounce water tank, a large water window, an ergonomic rubber-grip handle, an anti-calcium system, and an automatic retractable cord reel for tidy cord storage. The iron measures 10-7/16 by 4-5/16 by 5-1/8 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-DtRmcxTL._AC_SL1441_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B001AMP1W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001AMP1W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001AMP1W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462394,"name":"Floral Collage White Space by Marcee Duggar, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUVFdaUBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features purple flowers on a distressed background. I enjoy things that are old, worn, imperfect, rusty and peeling paint. My artwork reflects that love. I use lots of vintage imagery and blending of colors, shapes and textures in my art. All of my designs were created in photoshop. I love to make thing look real as possible. I want my art to reach out and grab you. I am also a great fan of fonts and typography and they way different fonts work together to create art. I am self taught and started on the very first digital scrapbooking site way back in 2004, creating artwork for scrapbookers and home crafters. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUVFdaUBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071HX6GHL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HX6GHL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HX6GHL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
