window.products.push({"id":462436,"name":"TUMZAK 12oz Insulated Coffee Mug with Handle, 2 Pack Stainless Steel Mug with Lid, Double Wall Vacuum Coffee Cup, Powder Coated Travel Mug, Thermal Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xeOCYxCJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TUMZAK 12oz Stainless Steel Coffee Mugs are tailor-made for those who like to drink beverages, so you can enjoyice water in the summer, or enjoy hot coffee with our iinsulated coffee mug in the morning when you go to bed inthe winter morning, and wake up a new day.Perfect sizes fit for handling it at home or office,outdoor, with-mouthdesign for putting ice and easy-washing.The Feature of insulated coffee mug with handle 1.Double-wall vacuum insulation. 2.Made of 304 Food Grade Stainless Steel. 3.Durable Powder Coating ,Protect Against Dents and Scratches. 4.Clear Splash Proof Lid.5.Flavor Free,Sweat proof Design.6.Long and wide handle.for Easy Grasping.7.Wide Mouth Opening Easy to Clean.8.Multiple colors to choose.Helpful Tips:1.Hand wash these stainless steel mug with sponge cloth or sponge ball dipped into warm water and set aside to air dry. 2.The travel mug with lid could be took apart,Please do not wash it in dishwasher in case that the mug would be scratched or pealing of paint. 3.When filling mugs with boiling liquid, allow it to cool down with the lid off for at least 3 minutes before attaching the lid.4.Always keep mugs out of reach of children when filled with hot liquids. 5.Do not overfill your vessel with hot drinks as there is a risk of spilling and scalding. 6.There is a straw hole on the lid, please do not invert the cup to avoid pouring. 7.The coffee mug is insulated,don't drink hot drinks too quickly and watch out for injuries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xeOCYxCJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tumzak","source_asin":"B08YK36C5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YK36C5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YK36C5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
