window.products.push({"id":462496,"name":"Bokang Portable Humidifiers, Small Cool Mist Ultrasonic Humidifier with Colorful Light,Auto Shut-Off, 2 Mist Modes, USB Personal Desktop Humidifier fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YCE2WHGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"* It is observed that dry weather can cause dry lips, itchy skin, coughing, sinus problems, and in more severe cases even cause breathing difficulties and other health problems. In a dry area static electricity forms that are very irritating and make the scalps dry. * Also dry weather can cause problems such as cracked wooden furniture, cracked musical instruments and wilted plants. * It is the time to buy a humidifier that will help you eliminate the above problems. How does a humidifier work? Humidifiers are devices that spray water vapor or steam to increase moisture levels in the air (humidity). Ultrasonic humidifiers produce a cool mist with ultrasonic vibration. Evaporators use a fan to blow air through a wet wick, filter or belt. How to use portable humidifiers? —Spray function: 1.Press the button to turn on the continuous spraymode. 2.Press the button again to open the gap spray mode.(Spray 3 seconds stop 3 seconds) 3.Press the button again to turn off the spray. —Night function: 1.Long press the button for 3 seconds to turn on the warm white atmosphere light. 2.Press the button for 3 seconds to turn on the colorful atmosphere light. 3.Press the button for 3 seconds to turn off the ambient light. Specification: -Regular shutdown: 5 hours -Material: ABS/silica gel/electrical piece -Product size: 75 * 75 * 120mm -Product weight: 106g -Rated input: DC5.0V/1.0A -Operating current: 250~350MA -Rated power:2W -Spray quantity: 30-45 ml / hour Package Includes: 1 X portable humidifier 1X USB cable(Up to 25 inches long) 1 X spare cotton swab 1 X manual Note: We recommend against using essential oils as to not obstruct the cotton filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YCE2WHGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bokang","source_asin":"B08S7M3WTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7M3WTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7M3WTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
