window.products.push({"id":462523,"name":"AMZCHEF Slow Juicer Machines Slow Masticating Juicer Cold Press Juicer Vegetables&Fruits Extractor 3'' Large Feed Chute Non-porous Filter Easy Clean& ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xR-HMW+wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍉【Higher Juice Yield】AMZCHEF Professional fruit and vegetable Slow Juicer, the innovative 80rpm slow screw can squeeze up to 98% of nutrient-rich juice: it can extract various fruits and leafy vegetables such as apples, oranges, wheatgrass and so on. 🍑【Retain More Nutrients】Compared with traditional blade juicer machine, our cold press juicers use low speed (80rpm) squeezing without damaging the cell wall, without heating the juice, and maximizing the nutritional value of fruits/vegetables such as vitamins and trace elements, and Reduced oxidation. Makes storage time longer. 🍎【2 Speeds, ≤60db Quiet】Two speeds are available, choose the right speed for your fruit to get higher juice output; \"soft\" speed is used for soft ingredients, and \"hard\" speed is used for hard ingredients , Effectively avoid the destruction of nutrients and vitamins: This slow masticating juicer has been quietly tested, and the noise is ≤60db. 🍋【Easy to use and Easy to clean】Open the safety lock, you can easily complete the assembly and disassembly within a few minutes, all materials are made of safe and high-quality raw materials, and a cleaning brush is included, which can be washed in the dishwasher. 🍇【AMCHEF Professional Services】Choose AMZCHEF and enjoy professional services. We provide you with a 1-year warranty, 24-hour quick response, and lifetime technical support. If you have any questions, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xR-HMW+wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amzchef","source_asin":"B09JWJ1H7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JWJ1H7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JWJ1H7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462524,"name":"JoyJolt Grant 19oz Beer Pint Glasses Set of 4. Large Beer Pint Glass Capacity in a Traditional Pub Drinking Glasses Design. Oversized Beer Glasses Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dKxK3wlEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THAT ‘PUB’ FEELING! Treat yourself, your mates, and any cerveza lover to a thick stout, craft beer or IPA with a glass that feels like time before social distancing! The Grant, set of 4 Bar Glasses are 5.75” tall, with a hefty 3.25” wide grip that feels like your ale was poured straight from a tap. A FULL PINT, AND ROOM TO FOAM: Grant Beer Drinking Glasses hold up to 19oz of your favorite Guinness, Stout, Craft, Lager, Ale, Bitter or Home Brew! So you can pour it like a 16oz Beer Glass with a handsome head, or go foam-free and treat them like good ol’ imperial pint UK pilsner glasses 20 oz. LOVES AN ICY COLD BREW: Made from thick glass with a 1.75oz heft and no imperfections or bubbles, you can safely pop these large beer glasses in the freezer for an ice cold, thirst-quenching brew. And when you’re done, into the dishwasher for easy washing up. At 5.75” tall, they’ll even fit the top rack. BEER TASTES BETTER: There’s nothing more disappointing than taking that first cold sip from a cheap, thin rim. You’re a man, and you need something you get your manly face into! We crafted each ale glass with a thick, rolled rim so each drink you take, feels and tastes like a “real” beer! SECURELY BOXED: The Grant 4 PC Beer Glassware Set comes securely bubble-wrapped in a thick box, so any plans for gifting will be success! Affordably priced for this type of quality, and with a 12 Month Guarantee, they’re an effortless and meaningful gift for anyone who likes to imbibe joy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dKxK3wlEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0B2QJ69FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2QJ69FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2QJ69FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
