window.products.push({"id":462724,"name":"BRTU - Double Wall Stainless Steel Water Bottle 17 oz – Travel Mug with Anti-Slip Design – 500ml Vacuum Insulated Sport Bottle – Keeps Proper Temperat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZFyc4u3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHOOSE THE BEST! No matter whether you’re a busy worker who always drinks coffee on the go or an athlete who always has to have water on hand, or both, our stainless-steel bottles will suit everyone. We took into account the demands of our potential clients and selected the highest quality stainless steel to make our indoor and outdoor bottle number one for you. Thanks to the simple modern stylish design, it serves as a reusable water bottle, travel mug bottle, tea/coffee mug, vacuum flask, athletic water bottle, hiking thermos, etc. It helps you to enjoy the taste of your favorite drinks and stay hydrated which is a basics for anybody. Main Benefits: ✔GREAT VACUUM INSULATION prevents the outside climate from impacting the temperature of your liquids. With our outdoor/indoor water bottle your hot beverages stay hot or at least quite warm for several hours even when it is cold outside and vice versa. ✔Our vacuum sealed water bottles DON’T ALTER THE TASTE of your drinks and don’t leave any aftertaste. ✔The LID SEALS TIGHT – it helps avoid accidental splashing, even during a bumpy ride. ✔EASY TO HOLD – unlike the bulky large water bottles, these are easy to hold in one hand and almost effortless to carry around ✔PERFECT SIZE (17 oz\\500ml), simple modern look and great design of our lightweight travel water bottle make it a great gift for men or women. It also serves well as a water bottle for kids ✔FITS MOST STANDARD CUPHOLDERS ✔STYLISH & MODERN water bottles Try this water bottle and let this portable item make your day-by-day activities more pleasant and special occasions for friends and family celebrated with such a nice gift. It helps you enjoy the taste of your favorite beverages and stay hydrated which is a basic need for anybody. It’s time to think about the environment, refuse plastic bottles, and start using this one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZFyc4u3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRTU","source_asin":"B07RS1XHLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RS1XHLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RS1XHLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
