window.products.push({"id":462819,"name":"Perfect Sleep Chair Lift Chair & Medical Recliner - Duralux Leather - Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811i-ZVWLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to a New Level of Comfort The Perfect Sleep Chair is the perfect solution for those nights when the bed just won’t do. Whether you suffer from heartburn, cardiac problems, hip or back aches, the Perfect Sleep Chair offers you a comfortable, fully adjustable alternative.  An overstuffed design, with pocketed coils in the seat and wide armrests, provides support and comfort like no other lift chair, no matter what position you choose.  The Perfect Sleep Chair also includes high and low heat settings for both the seat and the back to provide soothing relaxation, like a day at the spa. Medical Recliner & Lift Chair in One Our powered recliner technology lets you choose the position that’s best for you – simply pause the chair when you reach the most comfortable position. From fully upright, to the Trendelenburg position, to zero gravity position, where your body experiences a minimum of stress, to everything in between - you can set the recline level for an infinite number of positions.  Plus, if you sometimes have trouble getting up, the lift chair functionality will help put you safely on your feet with the press of a button, raising steadily and giving you the boost you need. The seat is 20” wide, 21.5” deep, and 20” high, while the top of the seat back is 29” from the seat. White Glove Delivery No need to worry about how to get the chair into your home. Delivery professionals will deliver the chair to the exact spot in your home where you want it. They will unpack it, test it, adjust the position to your liking, and even take all the packaging with them when they leave. Best in Class Warranty The Perfect Sleep Chair is designed and built to last, with a weight capacity of 375 lbs. Our warranty includes lifetime coverage on the lift frame and lift/recline mechanism. Hand-crafted with pride in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811i-ZVWLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Sleep Chair","source_asin":"B073645JSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073645JSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073645JSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
