window.products.push({"id":462915,"name":"CrystalAge Apache Tears Tumble Stone (25-30mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLF9bVOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sometimes known as the wizard's stone, this Apache Tears Tumble Stone is best known for its protective, loving and medicinal qualities. Tumblestones bring to you the beauty of rocks, minerals and gemstones, which are usually difficult to appreciate in their natural state. Tumbling, a long process of smoothing and polishing, reveals the wonderful colour and form of these natural treasures that are so often hidden deep in the earth. For thousands of years, stones have been polished to reveal their beauty and have always been associated with spiritual and healing properties. Tumble stones are perfect as healing stones, easy to carry with you or to offer as a crystal gift for those who could benefit from them. A stone not only for the esoteric enthusiast but for the crystal collector as well, these tumbled stones are an inexpensive way to develop a large and attractive collection. For detailed information about the properties of Apache, please visit our Crystal Information section. Product Code: T079-L Stone Types: \t \t Apache Tears","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pLF9bVOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B06Y98WVHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y98WVHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y98WVHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462916,"name":"Corelle Coordinates by Reston Lloyd Counter Protector Mats, Set of 2, Pretty Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BzoBCc8ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reston Lloyd produces high quality enamel on steel kitchen, melamine, and acrylic accessories to produce Corelle Coordinates as well as their private brand Calypso Basics. In addition, Reston Lloyd is the exclusive distributor for both Romertopf and MAWA which are home & kitchen products from Germany. These high end quality products are one of the corner stones to Reston Lloyd, who focus on quality merchandise from Germany. For nearly 30 years, we have been dedicated to providing the highest quality products, with an equal emphasis on superior customer service. This set of counter mats includes 2 mats: one is 10 x 8-inch and one is 7.5 x 6-inch. Each mat features the popular Corelle pattern Pretty Pink and will enhance your kitchen decor. Made of high quality tin with cardboard backing these counter protector mats can be used to protect your counter and dinner table from hot dishes. Use as a trivet or under a plant or on a craft table to protect when using a glue gun. Easy to clean - just wipe with a damp cloth and towel dry. Keep your kitchen looking clean and organized while enhancing your favorite Corelle dish pattern or kitchen decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BzoBCc8ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B073PFN19Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073PFN19Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073PFN19Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462917,"name":"KEEP Global Microfiber Cleaning Cloth - Super Absorbent & Fast Drying - Safe & Gentle for All Home Surfaces - Great for Cleaning Kitchens, Dishes, Spi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UFTUjgw+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Wouldn't you want to clean your home with the same products that the professionals use? Now you can with Keep Global's microfiber cloths!  *Exclusively used by one of the largest PROFESSIONAL cleaning companies in the world. *These towels clean multi-million dollar buildings and are now available for your own home. *High quality reusable towels reduce costs and help save money...which helps YOUR bottom line. WHY THE PROFESSIONALS USE KEEP GLOBAL MICROFIBER TOWELS: *The pros use microfiber due to the split fibers, which attract & grab on to more dust, dirt, grime and also allows 3-10x the absorption of a traditional towel. *By far, the THICKEST, SOFTEST, MOST ABSORBENT, Microfiber Towel on the market. *350 GSM - 60% Thicker than other popular towels on the market which will allow it to clean more than the rest *Will last 500 washes with proper care before needing to be replaced. WHY YOU WANT KEEP GLOBAL MICROFIBER TOWELS IN YOUR HOME: *If you have never experienced the difference between cotton vs microfiber towels...prepare to have your entire world changed! You'll never go back! *Save Time by cleaning spills faster and cleaning surfaces more efficiently *Save Money by not having to buy rolls and rolls of paper towels - No more visits to Costco! *Stay Organized with color coded towels , never mix your towels again! EXPERIENCE WHAT THE PROFESSIONALS HAVE KNOWN FOR YEARS, AND CLICK THE \"ADD TO CART\" BUTTON NOW!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UFTUjgw+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEEP Global","source_asin":"B01CUNI83K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CUNI83K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CUNI83K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
