window.products.push({"id":462945,"name":"Micro 25 LEDs Green String Lights,3AA Battery Operated on 9.2ft Long Silver Color Ultra Thin String Wire for Bedroom,Christmas, Wedding, Parties Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0XCeeYcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Free Shipping. Shipped within four days after the order.These 25 LEDs Micro LED Battery Operated String Lights are perfect for use as a lighting addition to any decorative project. Very thin wire hosts 25 very small LED bulbs that are about size of the rice grains and are intensely bright. With a steady 360 degree viewing angle, they illuminate in every direction. You'll be able to make any occasion or space extra special with these bright lights! The lights can be used indoor and are great for birthdays, gardens, weddings, dinner parties, girl's night in, bedrooms and more! They create a warm atmosphere that everyone will enjoy! Our OS LED string lights are easy to hide. When used with new batteries they last for over 48 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0XCeeYcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiona WONG","source_asin":"B01JR5KLNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JR5KLNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JR5KLNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":462946,"name":"American Salt Box Village by Cheryl Bartley, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ta0YotQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a folk art illustration of a tall tree between houses. American folk art painter, Cheryl Bartleyi1/2s artistic talent was apparent from an early age when she produced her first works of art as a means of communication. Raised by a French speaking family, she relied on a paintbrush and a box of paint to express herself to her English speaking friends. Her early love of expressing herself with her art resulted in working for over 25 years as a graphic artist in the manufacture of wallpaper and textiles. During these years, Cheryl developed the skills necessary to understand the technical aspects in the creation of wallpaper and textile design, color Theory, computer design, market trends, and the proper care and utilization of quality artist materials. Although trained as a graphic artist, Cheryl now unleashes her imagination and creativity from her I1/2Folk art Spiriti1/2 studio. The inspiration for her life long fascination with telling stories with paint is revealed in her folk art spirited creations. Each painting will enchant you with its detailed happy scenes of simpler times. She utilizes mixtures of vibrant colors to produce scenes from her imagination and actual places that are warm and inviting, vibrant and exciting. Her preferred medium is acrylic on canvas or wood, and watercolor on paper.Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ta0YotQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071GRDCP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-462946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071GRDCP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071GRDCP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
